# What a MeshCore room server or repeater said we are on its access list, on the node's Identity
# card beside what the node is. The age is part of the answer: the server keeps its list and
# never says when it drops us, so "read-only, 5m ago" is a report, not a session.

scene demo
clock 2026-01-15 12:00
login ECHO read-only
tab nodes
# Echo Repeater is seeds[5], so row 6 under the chip bar.
key down 6
key a
hold 1200
# Through Signal and both legs of its route to Identity.
key right
key right
key right
key right
hold 1600
